The solution is a shortest-path DP over stages in order. Let `dist[1] = 0`, and for each stage `i` relax `dist[i+1]` with `dist[i] + A_i` and `dist[X_i]` with `dist[i] + B_i`. Backward jumps (`X_i < i`) never help, since any route from an earlier stage back to `N` must pass through stage `i` again at extra cost. Answers can exceed 32 bits, so 64-bit integers are needed.

